## 📂 Repository Structure

```text
📦 8-Bit-Calculator-RTL-GDS-
 ┣ 📂 src/             # Verilog RTL source files (calculator.v, alu.v)
 ┣ 📂 tb/              # Testbench files for behavioral simulation
 ┣ 📂 constraints/     # SDC (Synopsys Design Constraints) files for timing
 ┣ 📂 synth/           # Synthesized gate-level netlists and reports
 ┣ 📂 pd/              # Physical design stage reports (Floorplan, CTS, Routing)
 ┣ 📂 images/          # Die layouts, block diagrams, and routing visualizer snaps
 ┣ 📂 gds/             # Final exported GDSII and LEF files
 ┗ 📜 README.md        # Project documentation